ation exclusively for the memorial, including puppets which represent patients in 1991. The crater on the ceiling, where a JNA shell fell but miraculously did not explode, was left unrepaired to show what damage was done.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2009-05-14","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<span class=\"int-own-work\" lang=\"en\">Own work</span>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=User:Seiya123&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:Seiya123 (page does not exist)\">Seiya123</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 3.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Creative Commons Attribution 3.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"true","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseUrl":{"value":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Copyrighted":{"value":"True","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"cc-by-3.0","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}},"mime":"image/jpeg"}]},{"pageid":8380207,"ns":6,"title":"File:Vukovarska bolnica 6.JPG","imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":812416,"width":2048,"height":1536,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Vukovarska_bolnica_6.JPG/960px-Vukovarska_bolnica_6.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":800,"thumbheight":600,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Vukovarska_bolnica_6.JPG/1920px-Vukovarska_bolnica_6.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Vukovarska_bolnica_6.JPG/960px-Vukovarska_bolnica_6.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikime